02:05:20.562 --> 02:05:22.562
While we may take a whole lifetime to do it, and vice versa.

709
02:05:23.562 --> 02:05:27.562
It goes crisscross, and the kingdom of God is a different concept than our chronological concept.

710
02:05:28.562 --> 02:05:29.562
It works differently.

711
02:05:30.562 --> 02:05:35.562
So if you are worried and you think, oh yes, I am certainly that third person.

712
02:05:36.562 --> 02:05:37.562
Because you have squandered it.

713
02:05:38.562 --> 02:05:41.562
Maybe even just yesterday, and you want to do it right.

714
02:05:42.562 --> 02:05:44.562
And you feel that you sometimes go back and forth.

715
02:05:45.562 --> 02:05:47.562
Oh my flesh and oh my spirit, how am I supposed to do this now?

716
02:05:48.562 --> 02:05:50.562
Do not be deceived.

717
02:05:51.562 --> 02:05:53.562
For there is indeed one person, and he is an accuser.

718
02:05:54.562 --> 02:05:57.562
His name is Satan, and he will surely come to you to accuse you.

719
02:05:58.562 --> 02:05:59.562
And to say, oh you are certainly that third person.

720
02:06:00.562 --> 02:06:01.562
You are certainly that third person.

721
02:06:02.562 --> 02:06:04.562
Be silent in the name of Jesus.

722
02:06:05.562 --> 02:06:07.562
For you have been set free by the Son.

723
02:06:07.562 --> 02:06:10.562
And you now have that ability in the name of Jesus.

724
02:06:11.562 --> 02:06:13.562
To be a five or two talent person.

725
02:06:14.562 --> 02:06:15.562
And it doesn't matter how many talents.

726
02:06:16.562 --> 02:06:17.562
What matters is reliability.

727
02:06:18.562 --> 02:06:21.562
Reliability is the keyword in the name of Jesus.

728
02:06:22.562 --> 02:06:24.562
And if you have not been reliable in your life.

729
02:06:25.562 --> 02:06:26.562
Then cry out to Jesus.

730
02:06:27.562 --> 02:06:28.562
For He is reliable for you.

731
02:06:31.562 --> 02:06:32.562
Let us set this right in prayer.

732
02:06:33.562 --> 02:06:34.562
While all eyes are closed.

733
02:06:35.562 --> 02:06:36.562
For I would like to pray for you.

734
02:06:37.562 --> 02:06:38.562
Let's keep those eyes closed, please.

735
02:06:39.562 --> 02:06:41.562
If you feel that I should pray for you.

736
02:06:42.562 --> 02:06:43.562
To set you free from fear.

737
02:06:44.562 --> 02:06:45.562
To set you free from worry.

738
02:06:46.562 --> 02:06:47.562
Or if you might be that third person.

739
02:06:48.562 --> 02:06:49.562
Then I would like to see your hand.

740
02:06:50.562 --> 02:06:51.562
So that I can pray for you.

741
02:06:52.562 --> 02:06:53.562
Can you raise your hand in the air for a moment.

742
02:06:54.562 --> 02:06:55.562
Thanks.

743
02:06:56.562 --> 02:06:57.562
Hands are going up everywhere.

744
02:06:58.562 --> 02:06:59.562
Thank you, thank you, that's it.

745
02:07:00.562 --> 02:07:01.562
You can put them down again.

746
02:07:02.562 --> 02:07:03.562
Thank you that this has resonance.

747
02:07:04.562 --> 02:07:06.562
And that multiple hands have gone up.

748
02:07:07.562 --> 02:07:08.562
In the name of Jesus.

749
02:07:09.562 --> 02:07:10.562
Christians, pray with me.

750
02:07:11.562 --> 02:07:12.562
In the name of Jesus.

751
02:07:13.562 --> 02:07:14.562
I want to pray that there will be relief.

752
02:07:15.562 --> 02:07:16.562
That there will be redemption in our hearts.

753
02:07:17.562 --> 02:07:19.562
Concern is not from the kingdom of God.

754
02:07:20.562 --> 02:07:23.562
We will be a holy nation before the throne of God.

755
02:07:24.562 --> 02:07:26.562
And we will come to receive our reward.

756
02:07:27.562 --> 02:07:28.562
And yes, there is work to be done.

757
02:07:29.562 --> 02:07:30.562
And yes, there is reliability to be gained.

758
02:07:31.562 --> 02:07:32.562
But Jesus, you want to shape us.

759
02:07:33.562 --> 02:07:34.562
Now, today.

760
02:07:34.562 --> 02:07:38.562
Lord, I want to pray that this heaviness of our hearts will be lifted.

761
02:07:39.562 --> 02:07:41.562
For in God's kingdom there may be no fear.

762
02:07:42.562 --> 02:07:43.562
For fear is not a good motivator.

763
02:07:44.562 --> 02:07:46.562
Lord, I want to pray that you set us free.

764
02:07:47.562 --> 02:07:49.562
So that we can truly tackle the talents.

765
02:07:50.562 --> 02:07:54.562
And that we can storm your kingdom without limits.

766
02:07:55.562 --> 02:07:56.562
Literally.

767
02:07:57.562 --> 02:07:58.562
And that we can do what you ask of us.

768
02:07:59.562 --> 02:08:00.562
In the name of Jesus.

769
02:08:01.562 --> 02:08:03.562
