770
02:08:04.562 --> 02:08:05.562
Who raised their hand.

771
02:08:06.562 --> 02:08:08.562
And even for that person who did not raise their hand.

772
02:08:09.562 --> 02:08:11.562
But also has these concerns.

773
02:08:12.562 --> 02:08:14.562
Lord, help us.

774
02:08:15.562 --> 02:08:17.562
Help us, Holy Spirit.

775
02:08:18.562 --> 02:08:21.562
I want to pray, Holy Spirit, help us.

776
02:08:22.562 --> 02:08:24.562
To please the Father.

777
02:08:25.562 --> 02:08:28.562
Help us to do the will of God.

778
02:08:29.562 --> 02:08:35.562
Help us to have the right motivation and the right urgency.

779
02:08:36.562 --> 02:08:38.562
A proper fear of the Lord and respect for God.

780
02:08:39.562 --> 02:08:42.562
And to understand the weight of His calling.

781
02:08:43.562 --> 02:08:46.562
Help us to separate this from accusation.

782
02:08:47.562 --> 02:08:51.562
Urgency and accusation, urgency and fear are two different things.

783
02:08:52.562 --> 02:08:54.562
Holy Spirit, help us.

784
02:08:55.562 --> 02:08:57.562
To see this rightly.

785
02:08:58.562 --> 02:09:00.562
Urgency to seek Him.

786
02:09:01.562 --> 02:09:03.562
Importance to do what He wants.

787
02:09:04.562 --> 02:09:06.562
Knowing that we have a judging God.

788
02:09:07.562 --> 02:09:09.562
Yes, certainly. Urgency.

789
02:09:10.562 --> 02:09:11.562
A fear of the Lord.

790
02:09:12.562 --> 02:09:13.562
Knowing that He means it.

791
02:09:14.562 --> 02:09:16.562
Knowing that He will come to judge the living and the dead.

792
02:09:17.562 --> 02:09:19.562
But through the blood of Christ.

793
02:09:20.562 --> 02:09:22.562
Victory in the name of Jesus.

794
02:09:23.562 --> 02:09:25.562
And no fear in Jesus' name.

795
02:09:26.562 --> 02:09:27.562
We praise your name.

796
02:09:28.562 --> 02:09:29.562
Amen.

797
02:09:30.562 --> 02:09:31.562
In the name of Jesus. Amen.

798
02:09:32.562 --> 02:09:33.562
Amen.

